      "writtenOn": "2021-12-13T16:49:44Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "\u003e We need to trigger a real panic so that the core push regs to the stack, switch context, etc.\n\nIn case of software panic, we jump to exception_panic (\"bl exception_panic\", see software_panic() in core/cortex-m/panic.c). Probably software panic is not handled properly - exception_panic needs exception frame on stack.",
